      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَمْصَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A hungering.</i> (S, K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْسَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِلْبَطْنَةِ خَيْرٌ مِنْ خَمْصَةٍ تَتْبَعُهَا</span> [<i>There is not anything better for repletion of the belly than a hungering which follows it</i>]. (S, A.)

